{
  "package": "memo-subagents",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "upstream": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/0xRichardH/pi-herdr-subagents",
    "tag": "v0.2.0",
    "commit": "7180d98",
    "npm": "pi-herdr-subagents@0.2.0 (tarball identical to the tag)",
    "derivedFrom": "https://github.com/HazAT/pi-interactive-subagents"
  },
  "importedFrom": {
    "commit": "17fdebb",
    "source": "pi-issue-round vendored copy (src/memo-subagents), itself the local package ~/.pi/agent/local-packages/pi-herdr-subagents (0.2.0 + local selector) plus the IR_CHILD_* driver patch"
  },
  "chain": [
    "pi-herdr-subagents v0.2.0 (upstream tag 7180d98)",
    "installed npm copy: terminal.ts made configurable with PI_SUBAGENT_SURFACE (split/tab)",
    "local package: pane selector (pane-selector.ts, default surface 'selector', /subagent picker, Ctrl+Alt+S, widget ▶, randomBytes(12) ids); bundled agents/, /plan and plan-skill.md removed",
    "pi-issue-round vendored copy: IR_CHILD_* host patch in harness/drivers/pi.ts",
    "memo-subagents 0.1.0: see changes"
  ],
  "changes": [
    "child-host.ts: MEMO_SUBAGENTS_CHILD_EXTENSIONS / MEMO_SUBAGENTS_CHILD_ENV replace IR_CHILD_* (which is no longer read); applied to fresh pi launches and to subagent_resume (buildResumeCommand).",
    "worktree.ts: optional git worktree isolation (plan/create/rollback/state/remove/registry, config.json `worktrees`).",
    "index.ts: worktree / worktreeBranch / worktreeBase parameters, dirty-source prompt, details.worktree in results, worktree-aware resume, subagent_worktrees tool (in SPAWNING_TOOLS), /subagent-worktrees command, widget/renderer badges.",
    "terminal.ts / herdr.ts: optional pane cwd argument (defaults to process.cwd() as before).",
    "Symbol.for('pi-subagents/*') runtime keys are unchanged; therefore never load together with pi-herdr-subagents.",
    "Tests live in test/ (upstream layout); test/integration copied from upstream v0.2.0 as opt-in (npm run test:integration)."
  ],
